  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madar - Knowing the other 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madar will continue to meet the Palestinian and Arab need for a research center that is specialized in the Israeli affairs. Its mission is &#x201c;to produce, publish, and disseminate knowledge about all aspects of Israeli affairs for Palestinian and Arab audiences&#x201d; by producing solid and comprehensive research and analysis about the Israeli scene.

Madar prioritizes enhancing the knowledge and understanding of the Israeli scene among Palestinian and Arab decision-makers, opinion-makers, and citizens. In pursuit of this goal, Madar has set two strategic Goals:  First strategic Goal: the production of credible and objective knowledge of relevance to the Palestinian and Arab audiences and contributes to enhancing knowledge in Israeli issues. Second strategic goal is to enhance its institutional performance to achieve its vision and mission.</narrative>
  </description>
